{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_210_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_210","textTraditional":"一、二十有九年，春，公至自乾侯，居於鄆。齊侯使高張來唁公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_210_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_210","textTraditional":"唁公不得入於魯也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_210_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_210","textTraditional":"二、公如晉，次於乾侯。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_210_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_210","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月，庚子，叔倪卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_210_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_210","textTraditional":"季孫意如曰：「叔倪無病而死，此皆無公也，是天命也，非我罪也。」","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_210_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_210","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_210_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_210","textTraditional":"五、冬，十月，鄆潰。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_210_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_210","textTraditional":"潰之為言，上下不相得也。上下不相得則惡矣，亦譏公也。昭公出奔，民如釋重負。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}